From fa89e8f4a2880b0a0357c67f0e37a08496456bce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Foxes Hung <foxes687@andestech.com>
Date: Wed, 31 Jan 2024 17:01:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 201/241] gdbstub: Refine ACE debugger relative code
 target/riscv: Refine ACE and ACE debugger code

This modification focus on ACE and ACE debugger coding style,
and also move ACE symbols pointer to CPU environment, so now
we can support maximum CPUs as system.

Signed-off-by: Foxes Hung <foxes687@andestech.com>
---
 gdbstub/andes_ace_gdb.c.inc                   |  55 +++++----
 gdbstub/andes_ace_gdb.h                       |  38 +++----
 gdbstub/system.c                              |   2 +-
 target/riscv/ace-helper.h                     |  71 +++++-------
 target/riscv/andes_ace_helper.c.inc           | 107 +++++++++---------
 target/riscv/andes_ace_helper.h               |  64 ++---------
 target/riscv/andes_helper.c                   |  10 +-
 target/riscv/andes_helper.h                   |   2 +-
 target/riscv/cpu.h                            |   7 ++
 target/riscv/gdbstub.c                        |  82 ++++++--------
 target/riscv/insn_trans/trans_xandesace.c.inc |   2 +-
 target/riscv/tcg/tcg-cpu.c                    |  10 +-
 12 files changed, 187 insertions(+), 263 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gdbstub/andes_ace_gdb.c.inc b/gdbstub/andes_ace_gdb.c.inc
index 288c904ea2..3338c415ed 100644
